 style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgis8StNBBz4bNmjMNTe_fN1Vp2axfmIuWxa4opF6I2qJdwZX8foSZ2bZsVKTJC5WeHhcOnGsq_KJo6zxlTyUtOxZTPMFVBzaKV3jICFog_heiVaAgplFq-ZCG5YUEI1yc5hMCXtfgFbZ6AQC2ZUpSDZo0quF4096-DLzvuVxQGiJunZV5eOFKXUTZhBhRL=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1477\" data-original-width=\"1108\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjN5QtRIs8VDGiT_EnYWVvf59lAVKds5BSySY3J6IEgeslZT9HikrNFVM_3mmhTRC7qIWLzQH85vlFAAx_euX0yqdWbNa1Mg5CSpejqhhXCE9DOWjpkMlHfJC_BHV6qNM7GK1QW1xYd3MA6-7s5uBjKPjg-c6pF4q7kU3xlk5a-wbEeEVPiInjdb32Vaksp=w480-h640\" width=\"480\" /></a></span></div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhezk6bVCpDUnnfbTNQVmc40pSqhaTrLZfwUc8Er-BS3k3T8OEc6pwSsDVLtyqKSerqSet3KNDzTTitgszggmIxT6La9bl-gRjATjfOoS9cxz-JDKzYLlv_A_IVArjO5kgLVEOchraXz53kDrCSr6_PKfYbWnz9SYk7MpnC3zS6stuh_Hq6FEW_DCm9TGlP\"><br /></a></div></span></div></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">7/26 4點以後，小可影著開票ê進度，khang-khòe就做無啥落--去--ah。勉強擋到5點，khang-khòe做煞，chiah允准家己哭--出-來。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">實在無心情tńg--去，後--來去到濟南路，一个人坐tī人群內底，失神失神，好佳哉竟然hō͘阮社區主委khioh--著（伊是罷團大力志工），hō͘伊chhōa去參文山退葆</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">團隊坐做伙。雖然人我iáu無熟sāi幾个，m̄-koh chit个時chūn有影需要伴。看逐家bì-lù pun--loeh，ná笑ná哭，互相安慰，滿滿ê情緒，真需要消化。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">「文山退葆」領銜人高麗菜來--ah，拄好坐到我邊--a，我kā攬chiok大一个，m̄-koh伊iáu是kā功勞lóng歸hō͘志工。我當然知影逐家lóng chiok無簡單，m̄-koh伊sòa--落-來koh有官司ài處理，賴士葆已經放聲叫伊ài細膩，實在真m̄甘。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">Chit改tī罷團內底看著真濟厲害ê角色，尤其是幾个少年查某囡仔，溫柔堅定，該歹就歹，實在chiok欣賞。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">阮社區主委是hō͘人感覺chiok安心ê大兄，坐我另外一爿，伊真緊就開始鼓勵逐家，思考lán koh ē-tàng做啥，伊本底想講今仔日結束了後ē-tàng小歇--一-下，m̄-koh chit-má soah認真leh思考kám tio̍h-ài出來選里長……。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人有影無簡單。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">舞台節目早早就結束，了後chiah是情緒tháu放ê開始。哭無啥mih無好，我感覺逐家實在m̄免苦勸人mài哭。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">阮哭，但是阮無失志，阮ùi互相無熟sāi，到組成強大ê團隊，今仔日了後，mā bē散--去，因為國家未來iáu真需要--阮。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">發起罷免，參與罷團，對個人來講，上大ê益處就是，你知影隊友tī佗位，知影危險ê時chūn ē-tàng信任siáng。志工之間，大部份其實互相連名to m̄知，但是逐家仝心拍過hiah-nī困難ê一戰，he革命感情kah信任感，koh有合作ê默契（be̍k-khè），是大罷免留--落-來上好ê禮物。</div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\">若m̄是因為賴士葆，我lóng m̄知文山區有hiah濟勇敢ê台灣人。</div></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">&nbsp;1 編註：台北市文山南中正（台北市第八選舉區）罷免團隊ê名。</span></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: init